         *  Bit 8 (RTO): Response timeout;
         *  Bit 7 (DCRC): Data CRC error;
         *  Bit 6 (RCRC): Response CRC error;
         *  Bit 5 (RXDR): Receive FIFO data request;
         *  Bit 4 (TXDR): Transmit FIFO data request;
